cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below (preferred citation) and this repository."
title: "GOUAI-train: training and validation of the GOUAI neural networks on new hybrid heavy-ion events"
abstract: >-
  Step-by-step training, cross-validation and comparison pipeline of the GOUAI neural networks, which
  predict the event-by-event charged-particle multiplicity and mean transverse momentum (pT >= 0.15 GeV)
  of a JETSCAPE hybrid model (TRENTo, free streaming, MUSIC, iS3D, SMASH) from the initial condition,
  for Pb-Pb collisions at 2.76 TeV and Au-Au collisions at 200 GeV.
authors:
